<html><head><title>Your Expedition Begins!</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Your Expedition Begins!</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Dear researcher, welcome to the TRAIL. This is a practical guide for navigating the world of transdisciplinary work and learning. This tool helps you to understand, develop and implement transdisciplinary education.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Transdisciplinary education serves as a bridge between theory and practical application, between education, research, and society. Explore how you can connect your research ambitions with forward-thinking students and the world outside academia.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Whether you are an experienced researcher or just finding your way, </span><span style="margin: 0px">the TRAIL</span><span style="margin: 0px"> is here to support you, regardless of your background. Together, we can tackle real-world challenges and make a meaningful impact.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin: 16px 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Let's</span><span style="margin: 0px"> begin!</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div></body></html>